        10("<div style='font-weight: bold'>CQRS Unit of Work</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Custom .NET command and query handlers]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns IDE application logic.<br />Dispatches typed commands and<br />read-only queries to<br />registered handlers with<br />scoped context, validates<br />eligibility, and returns or<br />publishes their outcomes.</div>")
        style 10 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        11("<div style='font-weight: bold'>IDE ViewModels (View)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.ComponentModel and SimpleMVC]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Implement IView with a stable<br />ViewKey. Raise<br />CommandRequested, receive<br />correlated results on the UI<br />thread, and expose observable<br />properties through<br />ObservableObject.</div>")
        style 11 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        12("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Editor Tab ViewModels (View)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: CommunityToolkit.Mvvm.ComponentModel and SimpleMVC]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>One observable IView per<br />editor tab. The ViewModel<br />defines the public MCP<br />context for its workspace,<br />document, view key, and<br />revision.</div>")
        style 12 fill:#17665b,stroke:#10473f,color:#ffffff
        13("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Language Services</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET, framed LSP JSON-RPC over stdio]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Manages configured server<br />processes, workspace roots<br />and language bindings.<br />Synchronizes versioned<br />documents, queues committed<br />saves before subsequent<br />close, and correlates<br />negotiated completion,<br />navigation, diagnostics, and<br />edit requests.</div>")
        style 13 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        14("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Project Explorer</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia and Dock.Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Dockable tree of project and<br />folder roots. Restores stable<br />roots, expansion and<br />selection. Loads children on<br />demand, refreshes affected<br />expanded branches, and offers<br />Open and Reveal for the<br />active workspace.</div>")
        style 14 fill:#17665b,stroke:#10473f,color:#ffffff
        15("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Explorer Filesystem Watcher</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET FileSystemWatcher]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Coalesces external changes by<br />workspace root and directory,<br />tracks missing roots, and<br />requests refresh for affected<br />expanded branches on the<br />Avalonia dispatcher.</div>")
        style 15 fill:#17665b,stroke:#10473f,color:#ffffff
        16("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Source Control</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia and Dock.Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Dockable repository and<br />worktree view for status,<br />diffs, staging, history,<br />branches, remotes, and<br />conflict workflows. Binds the<br />registered Git commands.</div>")
        style 16 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        17("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Git Service</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET handlers and native Git CLI]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Runs installed Git for a<br />captured checkout. Reads<br />machine state, validates<br />reviewed Git mutations,<br />publishes prepared index<br />updates, and reports typed<br />results for repository,<br />conflict, worktree,<br />submodule, and LFS workflows.</div>")
        style 17 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        18("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Git Checkout Validation</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET GitMutationLease]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Acquires the shared write<br />gate, then discovers the<br />worktree again and checks the<br />resolved worktree, Git<br />directory, and common<br />directory paths against the<br />captured selection. Releases<br />the gate on failure.</div>")
        style 18 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        19("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Workspace Write Gate</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET asynchronous semaphore]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Coordinates reviewed Git<br />writes, repository setup,<br />prepared index publication,<br />and editor file replacement<br />across worktrees in the same<br />IDE process.</div>")
        style 19 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        20("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Editor File Publication</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET PreparedDocumentSave]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Stages the captured source<br />text, waits for the shared<br />write gate, and replaces the<br />file after the originating<br />registration and save<br />revision are rechecked.</div>")
        style 20 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        21("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Integrated Terminal</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET and Porta.Pty]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Validates the selected<br />checkout before starting the<br />native shell. Supports scoped<br />tab and MCP input, resizing,<br />bounded transcript reads, and<br />exit state.</div>")
        style 21 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        22("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Source Editor</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: AvaloniaEdit.TextEditor]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Keeps independent tab<br />buffers, selection, caret,<br />undo and redo through<br />floating and redocking.<br />Provides find and replace,<br />syntax and plain fallback,<br />and diagnostic fixture<br />navigation. Live build<br />diagnostics and debugger<br />markers are later<br />integrations.</div>")
        style 22 fill:#17665b,stroke:#10473f,color:#ffffff
        23("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Avalonia UI Dispatcher</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia Dispatcher.UIThread]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Schedules callbacks on the UI<br />thread. The dispatch owner<br />checks its originating<br />registration inside the<br />callback before applying the<br />result.</div>")
        style 23 fill:#235c49,stroke:#184033,color:#ffffff
        24("<div style='font-weight: bold'>IDE State (Model)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Provides observable<br />workspace, presentation<br />culture, active document and<br />target, selected session,<br />availability, operation<br />state, interaction blocks by<br />scope, and diagnostics.</div>")
        style 24 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        25("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Project and Launch Workflow</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Selects the target preset,<br />runs the configured build,<br />opens source diagnostics, and<br />launches or attaches after a<br />successful build.</div>")
        style 25 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        26("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Session Coordinator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorSessionCoordinator and PinnedEmulatorSession]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Negotiates the installed<br />binding's contract, validates<br />the opened session identity<br />and close policy, and<br />transfers the package lease<br />to the pinned session.<br />Fixture adapters verify<br />launch, attach, reconnect,<br />and release.</div>")
        style 26 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        27("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Typed Session Control</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorSessionControl]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Checks captured identity,<br />grants, capabilities,<br />revisions, and payloads<br />before routing to advertised<br />ports. Correlates exact<br />retries, operation receipts,<br />and uncertain outcomes.</div>")
        style 27 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        28("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Session Subscriptions</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorSubscriptions and BufferedEmulatorMedia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Reserves provider<br />subscriptions, tracks ordered<br />control cursors and gaps, and<br />buffers media independently.<br />Drains pending and paused<br />subscriptions before the<br />provider connection closes.</div>")
        style 28 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        29("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Machine Descriptor and Memory Map</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET IMachineDescriptorPort and MachineMap]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Validates the session's<br />descriptor schema, CPU and<br />address spaces. Watches<br />ordered map revisions,<br />rechecks current capability<br />and map scope before mapped<br />operations, and retains<br />independently advertised raw<br />inspection.</div>")
        style 29 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        30("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Verified Package Profiles</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET declarative profile validation]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Checks each declared debugger<br />profile's reference, schema,<br />path, and digest. Projects<br />available profile references<br />into project selection and<br />resolves the active<br />descriptor's reference under<br />its pinned package lease.</div>")
        style 30 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        31("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulation and Replay View</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Presents video, input<br />capture, host volume, and<br />available frame capture. A<br />seekable recording drives the<br />replay playhead; live<br />emulation shows elapsed time.</div>")
        style 31 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        32("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Debugger and Guest Inspectors</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Displays CPU-specific<br />registers, platform<br />disassembly, bounded memory<br />and bank selection, reference<br />timing, and advertised live<br />clock-phase or bus data.<br />Captures the user's<br />byte-order display choice and<br />exposes available raw and<br />guest inspection.</div>")
        style 32 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        33("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Debugger Target Model</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Validates the active<br />session's descriptor, CPU and<br />map revision. Projects<br />supporting views and bounded<br />inspection scope. Applies<br />Emulator default,<br />Little-endian, or Big-endian<br />to multibyte display values.</div>")
        style 33 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        34("<div style='font-weight: bold'>CPU References and Display Profiles</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET, declarative profile data]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Resolves versioned register<br />and flag definitions, opcode<br />encodings, addressing rules,<br />reference timing and platform<br />display profiles for the<br />6502, 6809, Z80, 8080, 8086,<br />6800, and 68000 families.<br />Resolves package-supplied<br />declarative profiles to the<br />selected version.</div>")
        style 34 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        35("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Media, Tests, and Diagnostics</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Presents media and snapshot<br />workflows, test results,<br />operation progress, and<br />failure evidence with<br />adapter-provided identity and<br />compatibility.</div>")
        style 35 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        36("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Agent Session and Activity</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Presents agent launch and<br />attach commands, scoped<br />operations, denials,<br />transport failures, and<br />reattachment state.</div>")
        style 36 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        37("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Agent Gateway</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET and MCP]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Handles configured process<br />launch and attach for<br />authorized agent workflows.</div>")
        style 37 fill:#275c60,stroke:#d9a669,color:#ffffff
        38("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Retro IDE MCP Host</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Official MCP C# SDK, Microsoft.Extensions.Hosting, ASP.NET Core]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Exposes registered IDE tools<br />through the shared CQRS<br />dispatcher. Generates schemas<br />from public ViewModel<br />contracts, verifies live<br />context and grants, and<br />returns scoped operation<br />handles for supported<br />background calls including<br />package refresh.</div>")
        style 38 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        39("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Scoped Background Operations</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET WorkbenchOperations]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Tracks accepted and running<br />work, cancellation, and typed<br />success or failure. Checks<br />the original actor grant<br />before reading, cancelling,<br />or returning an operation<br />result.</div>")
        style 39 fill:#235c49,stroke:#62aa88,color:#ffffff
        4("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Workbench and Docking (View)</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia and Dock.Avalonia]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Hosts menus, command bars,<br />keyboard bindings, documents,<br />and docked tools. Presents<br />command metadata and<br />localization, and applies the<br />system wait cursor to<br />logically blocked UI.</div>")
        style 4 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        40("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulators Management View</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Avalonia EmulatorsPane and EmulatorsViewModel]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Browses buckets, compatible<br />releases, and installed<br />versions. Shows project<br />version history, binding<br />readiness, and verified<br />profiles. Refreshes after UI<br />or MCP changes and discards<br />results for superseded<br />project selections.</div>")
        style 40 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        41("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Emulator Bundle Manager</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorWorkspace, Git, JSON, SHA-256]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Reads Git bucket manifests at<br />a recorded commit, selects a<br />compatible host target,<br />verifies archives and entry<br />points, and publishes<br />immutable versions with<br />receipts. Persists project<br />pins and rollback history.</div>")
        style 41 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        42("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Pinned Adapter Resolver</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET EmulatorWorkspace and EmulatorBundleStore]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Resolves the project's<br />selected installed bundle for<br />the host and contract<br />version. Checks the<br />installation receipt and<br />binding entry point, exposes<br />verified profile references,<br />and supplies a lease for<br />session open.</div>")
        style 42 fill:#24557b,stroke:#74a9d0,color:#ffffff
        5("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Predefined Command Catalog</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: CommunityToolkit.Mvvm and typed .NET requests]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Registers typed IDE commands<br />and queries with stable IDs<br />and required capabilities.<br />Pairs UI commands with<br />Toolkit bindings and<br />localized metadata. Supplies<br />the MCP tool registry.</div>")
        style 5 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        6("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Localization Service</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: .NET localization]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Resolves typed text and image<br />slugs through exact locale,<br />parent locales, and bundled<br />English. Formats messages and<br />refreshes workbench<br />presentation when the UI<br />culture changes.</div>")
        style 6 fill:#17665b,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        7[("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Locale Catalogs</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: BCP 47 locale tags]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Supplies versioned catalogs<br />of strings, message patterns,<br />and local SVG or PNG<br />resources. Includes the<br />bundled default catalog and<br />validated language packs.</div>")]
        style 7 fill:#17665b,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        8("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Main MVC Controller</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: GPS.SimpleMVC 2.0.0]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns dispatch and result<br />delivery for views registered<br />directly with it. Provides<br />the shared execution entry<br />point for typed requests from<br />all controllers into the<br />custom Unit of Work.</div>")
        style 8 fill:#275c60,stroke:#4eb9aa,color:#ffffff
        9("<div style='font-weight: bold'>Document Controller</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: GPS.SimpleMVC 2.0.0]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Owns dispatch for editor<br />views that register directly<br />with it. Receives their<br />events, dispatches typed<br />document requests through the<br />shared CQRS entry point, and<br />delivers results to the<br />originating tab.</div>")
        style 9 fill:#17665b,stroke:#10473f,color:#ffffff
